  "instance_name": "gendered_domestic_role_stereotype",
  "label": "Gendered Domestic Role Stereotype",
  "description": "This stereotype assigns specific domestic tasks to men and women based on gender, often portraying women as the primary caregivers and cooks. The meme relies on this by having the man claim the dishwasher is 'chopping vegetables,' which is a task stereotypically associated with women, thus reinforcing the idea that women are the ones who should be doing such work. The humor comes from the absurdity of an appliance mimicking a gendered role.",
